{
  "description": "Hand-written evaluation set for the part matcher. Every expected_mpn is a real part in the seeded synthetic catalog (seed 20240815). Inputs imitate how part numbers actually arrive: pasted from spreadsheets, retyped off reel labels, copied out of distributor carts, or read aloud over a phone. The ten 'nonexistent' cases must return no_match; they are what the false-positive rate is measured on.",
